# Pre-commit gate.
#
# Two stages, cheapest first:
#   1. lint-staged  — lint + format ONLY the files being committed (fast).
#   2. npm test     — the offline chat-engine suite (~1s, no DB, no server).
#
# Keeping this under a couple of seconds is the point: a hook that is slow gets
# bypassed with --no-verify, and a hook that is bypassed protects nothing.
# The heavier cross-role integration suite needs a running backend, so it stays
# a deliberate `npm run test:integration` before opening a PR.

npx lint-staged || exit 1
npm test || exit 1
